{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Halley Mission: 2061\u00a0</strong>launches you into an epic sci-fi adventure among the stars! In this survival crafting RPG, you play as a retired astronaut called back into action for a top-secret mission near the perihelion of Halley's Comet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded in the vast, desolate reaches of space, you'll face survival challenges like never before. Will you carefully ration your limited supplies, or use your ingenuity to build a fully functional space base and achieve self-sufficiency? Every decision matters \u2014 managing your resources and time wisely will be the key to completing your mission.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Insomnia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2909640/a1fc9b3dca681f5d74fef9933578498ef34dcc35.jpg"},{"name":"Family","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2909640/f76ef20f9a5a4dfa61b0a06bdacc2fe8a0e8fc7f.jpg"},{"name":"Comet Navigator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2909640/1194ce25a09e8ca1c97fd0e82bfa516bbe14bda4.jpg"},{"name":"Time flies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2909640/268e6761b8abfe524531ba5345ee8aecc1759959.jpg"},{"name":"Vacation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2909640/ee65e23021fbddc1f3628196fbb9b7890105086c.jpg"},{"name":"Chemist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2909640/4ab0d7d3e75c641cde651893bf41e6c211476e72.jpg"},{"name":"Fully Armed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2909640/f91f66052ec9fedf4a8a03985d124eba3e2f58c9.jpg"},{"name":"Voyage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2909640/ee65e23021fbddc1f3628196fbb9b7890105086c.jpg"},{"name":"Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam